ex:\\n1449 | \\n1450 |         >>> idx = pd.DatetimeIndex(\\n1451 |         ...     [\"1/1/2020 10:00:00+00:00\", \"2/1/2020 11:00:00+00:00\"]\\n1452 |         ... )\\n1453 |         >>> idx.time\\n1454 |         array([datetime.time(10, 0), datetime.time(11, 0)], dtype=object)\\n1455 |         \"\"\"\\n1456 |         # If the Timestamps have a timezone that is not UTC,\\n1457 |         # convert them into their i8 representation while\\n1458 |         # keeping their timezone and not using UTC\\n1459 |         timestamps = self._local_timestamps()\\n1460 | \\n1461 |         return ints_to_pydatetime(timestamps, box=\"time\", reso=self._creso)\\n```\\n\\n\\n\\n##Searching for term \"index\"...\\n### Search Result:\\nFound function `pandas/conftest.py:index`.\\nFound function `pandas/_typing.py:SequenceNotStr.index`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/apply.py:NDFrameApply.index`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/strings/accessor.py:StringMethods.index`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/internals/managers.py:SingleBlockManager.index`.\\nFound function `pandas/io/formats/csvs.py:CSVFormatter.index`.\\nSource: Match found for entity name `index`.\\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\\n\\n\\n\\n##Searching for term \"values\"...\\n### Search Result:\\nFound function `pandas/core/generic.py:NDFrame.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/series.py:Series.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/frame.py:DataFrame.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/apply.py:FrameApply.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/multi.py:MultiIndex.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/period.py:PeriodIndex.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/datetimelike.py:DatetimeTimedeltaMixin.values`.\\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/base.py:Index.values`.\\nSource: Match found for entity name `values`.\\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.'\n"}, {"content": "<execute_ipython>\nprint(\"Further verification for